<title>USA: Applied Analytical holds Mercury paper.</title>
<headline>Applied Analytical holds Mercury paper.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, N.C. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Analytical Industries Inc said on Tuesday it owns $4 million of Mercury Finance Co commercial paper, but is unsure what effect Mercury's current troubles will have on the situation.</p>
<p>The paper held by Applied Analytical matures later this week.</p>
</text>
